WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:03.418 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
Before you open The Signal, here is

00:00:03.418 --> 00:00:05.836 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
what the free first gate is for.

00:00:05.836 --> 00:00:08.600 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
Numinous is a place to meet each new

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:11.018 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
vision without rushing to the next image.

00:00:11.018 --> 00:00:13.782 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
This film is an orientation, not a receipt

00:00:13.782 --> 00:00:16.545 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
and not proof that any account has access.

00:00:16.545 --> 00:00:20.000 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
When you choose to enter, the gate opens through Whop.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:22.072 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
There is no card requirement and

00:00:22.072 --> 00:00:24.145 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
no recurring charge for The Signal.

00:00:24.145 --> 00:00:26.563 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
The room is meant to stay free.

00:00:26.563 --> 00:00:29.327 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
Start with Dispatches: a place to find announcements

00:00:29.327 --> 00:00:32.090 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
and follow what is new in the realms.

00:00:32.090 --> 00:00:34.163 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
You do not have to buy

00:00:34.163 --> 00:00:36.236 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
a second product to remain here.

00:00:36.236 --> 00:00:39.690 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
Take the time to look around before making that choice.

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:52.725 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
The First Vision is the entry reading for this world.

00:00:52.725 --> 00:00:56.451 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
It introduces the chambers and gives you a way to

00:00:56.451 --> 00:00:59.804 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
approach the record before you follow a larger cycle.

00:00:59.804 --> 00:01:02.784 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
The rooms have different purposes, and this tour

00:01:02.784 --> 00:01:05.392 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
is only a preview of their names.

00:01:05.392 --> 00:01:07.627 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
The Signal is the open beginning.

00:01:07.627 --> 00:01:11.352 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
The Realm is where a new being comes into view.

00:01:11.352 --> 00:01:14.705 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
The Process turns attention to the craft behind the

00:01:14.705 --> 00:01:18.058 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
vision: what was made and how it was shaped.

00:01:18.058 --> 00:01:21.411 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
The Records hold the story underneath the image, so

00:01:21.411 --> 00:01:24.764 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
the work can be revisited rather than scrolled past.

00:01:24.764 --> 00:01:28.489 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
These rooms are shown here as a map, not as

00:01:28.489 --> 00:01:31.842 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
a promise that your browser has already unlocked them.

00:01:31.842 --> 00:01:34.077 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
Check your Whop library for the

00:01:34.077 --> 00:01:35.940 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
access available to your account.

00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:49.280 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
The Session marks a moment to

00:01:49.280 --> 00:01:51.939 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
return to the work and ask questions.

00:01:51.939 --> 00:01:54.219 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
The Field Journal leaves room for

00:01:54.219 --> 00:01:56.878 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
your own notes as the story changes.

00:01:56.878 --> 00:01:59.917 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
The Sanctuary is the shared space around the

00:01:59.917 --> 00:02:03.337 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
gates: a place to stay connected to other travellers.

00:02:03.337 --> 00:02:07.136 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
The calendar shows the rhythm of future realms and announcements.

00:02:07.136 --> 00:02:10.555 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
You can follow those signals at your own pace.

00:02:10.555 --> 00:02:13.975 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
No additional gate is required to keep The Signal.

00:02:13.975 --> 00:02:16.634 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
The Watcher is a separate membership if

00:02:16.634 --> 00:02:19.294 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
you later want a structured twenty-eight-day cycle.

00:02:19.294 --> 00:02:21.953 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
The Vault and the Agent are also

00:02:21.953 --> 00:02:24.613 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
separate choices, not conditions for entry here.

00:02:24.613 --> 00:02:27.652 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
If you want the free gate, use the

00:02:27.652 --> 00:02:31.071 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
button below this film to review the Whop entry.

00:02:31.071 --> 00:02:34.871 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
After you join, verify the room in the Whop account

00:02:34.871 --> 00:02:38.290 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
you used; this page cannot grant access by itself.
